flowchart TB
  subgraph OWNERS[Owning repositories]
    GGEN[ggen\nmanufacture world]
    MARKET[ggen-marketplace\nreusable DDUI grammar pack]
    GYMACT[GymAct\nbounded world / episode semantics]
    AUTOFDE[AutoFDE\ngoverned delivery world]
    CASTLE[CASTLE\nauthority / security world]
  end

  GGEN --> FED[Federated admitted world]
  MARKET --> FED
  GYMACT --> FED
  AUTOFDE --> FED
  CASTLE --> FED

  ENGINE[wasm4pm DDUI v2\nexact projection engine] --> P[Deterministic projection P]
  FED --> P
  AVATAR[Avatar alpha] --> P
  CONTEXT[Context kappa] --> P
  AUTH[Authority rho] --> P
  GRAMMAR[Bounded grammar Gamma] --> P

  P --> FRONTIER[DfCM reversible presentation frontier]
  FRONTIER --> SCREEN[Screen IR]

  SCREEN --> CEO[CEO projection]
  SCREEN --> CFO[CFO projection]
  SCREEN --> CTO[CTO projection]
  SCREEN --> ENG[Engineer projection]
  SCREEN --> AUD[Auditor projection]

  SCREEN --> INTENT[Unselected intent]
  INTENT --> SELECT[SELECT]
  INTENT --> CONSTRUCT[CONSTRUCT]
  INTENT --> BROKER[Owning broker / BRCE]
  BROKER --> DO[DO]
  SCREEN -. no direct actuation .-> DO
  LLM[LLM / AGI] -. no runtime render authority .-> P

  SCREEN --> RECEIPT[Screen receipt]
  RECEIPT --> REPLAY[Exact replay]

  FED -. preserves scoped standing .-> STANDING[Per-repository standing\nUNKNOWN / PARTIAL_ALIVE / ALIVE / BLOCKED / BUILD_BROKEN / UNSUPPORTED]
